{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E754_053.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "This is... a little more than I expected.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You been here before?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Are you nervous?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Use your imagination.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Heh... Sorry. I guess this is the first time[n]I've come here with someone I'm[n]actually into.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "That answer your question?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Yeah, in a way.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "It's my first time coming here with[n]someone I'm actually into, so.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...Just when I think he can't surprise me[n]anymore... my guinea pig somehow[n]keeps outdoing himself.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "A guy like you is wasted on me,[n]you know. It's a real tragedy.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You're the one I want.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You're all I see.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Heh. I didn't mean to go fishing for[n]that... but thanks.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Sorry. One second.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "When should I give her the gift?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "○○○ is calling me...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I can't answer this now...!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "High in demand, huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's not a big deal.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_013_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Don't worry about it.",
   "uk": "Не зважайте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "No, no, be my guest. White Day[n]must be a busy day for you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Sorry about that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Announcer",
   "en": "Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for[n]joining us on this special day.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Announcer",
   "en": "We wish you all an unforgettable[n]evening, with one last finishing touch[n]from us...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...? What's going on?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Whoa...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "This is for you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_020_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I want you to have this.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "What...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...Thank you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "A starry cityscape and roses, huh?[n]Don't you think that's a little much?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Not at all.",
   "uk": "Анітрохи.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Are you happy?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Maybe I overdid it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Really. Not at all?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I can't even tell if that's sarcasm.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Since it's you. If anyone else tried this,[n]they'd get my customer service smile.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I guess you got a real one out of me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Maybe.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Still, caught me off-guard, so...[n]I guess it must have worked.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...That's something I've always liked[n]about you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "It's never just about you. You always[n]go to these crazy lengths to make[n]other people happy...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I really admire that. And I guess I've[n]been trying to learn from it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Makes me think I've gotta work on[n]myself a little before I deserve you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You already do.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_029_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I admire you just as much.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Sweet thing to say.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_031_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Well, after all this effort, I should at[n]least return the favor somehow. Maybe[n]my guinea pig has a suggestion?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_032_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Takemi and I spent some[n]time alone together...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_032_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_032_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Once it got late, I walked her[n]back to the clinic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}